<title>USA: TABLE- Araldica Wineries July FY profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Araldica Wineries July FY profit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ROCHELLE, N.Y. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Income Statement				  Year ended 31 July</p>
<p>Net sales</p>
<p>   Wine							     466,626</p>
<p>   Food							     648,791</p>
<p>   Spirits							  233,383</p>
<p>   Other							     55,174</p>
<p>   Total							  1,403,974</p>
<p> Cost of sales						    966,738</p>
<p> Gross profit						     428,262</p>
<p>Selling/general &amp; administrative</p>
<p>									373,663</p>
<p> Net income							 $54,599</p>
<p> Shares outstanding					  10,610,072</p>
<p> Earnings per share						  0.01</p>
<p>NOTE: Araldica Wineries Ltd made the transition from development to full operation during the reported year. It expects to become a fully reporting public company on October 1.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
